# Guide + Start opens Quick Settings over the game; B closes it.
press guide
advance 100
tap start 60
release guide
advance 400
tap dpad-down 40
tap east 40
advance 200
---
shifts mode Guide layers -                            @0
overlay none + info 1                                 @100
shifts mode - layers -                                @100
overlay menu "In-game menu" selected "Quick Settings" @100
sound guide Open rise                                 @100
sound guide Step pulse                                @560
overlay menu "In-game menu" selected "Edit Controls"  @560
overlay none                                          @600
sound guide Close fall                                @600
